    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, use peroxide? i heard that can actually mess with the skin if it's deep. and what do u mean by 'seal it up'? should i just put some superglue on it once i've cleaned it so the dirt doesn't get back in? i really need to keep working so i want to make sure it stays closed up and protected.",
